00:00:04.723 --> 00:00:06.803
I'm very very excited
about our conversation

00:00:06.803 --> 00:00:10.603
that I'm about to have
with Nikole-Hannah Jones.

00:00:10.603 --> 00:00:12.483
But before we jump into the conversation,

00:00:12.483 --> 00:00:15.493
I wanna give my standard
announcements reminder.

00:00:15.493 --> 00:00:17.663
That Khan Academy is a not
