00:00:17.663 --> 00:00:20.883
We can only exist through
philanthropic donations from folks

00:00:20.883 --> 00:00:23.193
like yourself, so if you're
in a position to do so,

00:00:23.193 --> 00:00:25.021
please think about
donating to Khan Academy

00:00:25.021 --> 00:00:28.003
@khanacademy.org/donate.

00:00:28.003 --> 00:00:30.273
I also wanna give a special
